### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/healthz

### Ready
GET http://localhost:8000/readyz

### Users
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users

### Catalog
GET http://localhost:8000/api/catalog?category=ai&limit=5

### Recommendations
POST http://localhost:8000/api/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "u_alex",
  "k": 10,
  "candidate_pool": 60,
  "context": {
    "device": "web",
    "region": "US",
    "onboarding_topics": "ai,design,automation"
  },
  "use_cache": false
}

### Feedback
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "u_alex",
  "item_id": "vid_001",
  "event_type": "like",
  "value": 1.0
}

